      "title": "Positions — $display_currency",
      "description": "One row per holding per account, priced at its latest close. Cost basis and average cost follow the average-cost method: a buy raises the average (fees included), a sell books realized P/L and leaves the average alone. Fully sold positions stay listed while they carry realized P/L.",
